Comment: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Thank you for the food we're about to eat...
Comment: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:45.88,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,== ED ==
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:18.45,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:19.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:29.13,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:33.55,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:34.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:36.22,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Reina?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:40.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:42.06,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. We came to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:42.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:43.85,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:45.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, do you like sweet buns?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.14,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:48.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Round sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:49.86,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Then I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, pour some barley tea for Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:55.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Reina, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:57.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You came right during snack time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:00:58.74,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I want snacks, too!
