Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:03.60,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}B{\1c&H798A37&}u{\1c&H719747&}t{\1c&H6BA254&} {\1c&H65AC60&}s{\1c&H5EB96F&}o{\1c&H55C881&}m{\1c&H4ADB98&}e{\1c&H43E8A8&}t{\1c&H51E0AD&}i{\1c&H61D8B3&}m{\1c&H7DC8BC&}e{\1c&H93BDC3&}s{\1c&HA4B3C9&} {\1c&HB9A7D0&}w{\1c&HD499D8&}e{\1c&HE58FDE&}'{\1c&HED8EDB&}r{\1c&HEE96CD&}e{\1c&HEF9DC0&} {\1c&HF0A6AE&}w{\1c&HF1AF9D&}e{\1c&HF2B88D&}a{\1c&HF3BF7F&}k{\1c&HF4C475&},{\1c&HF4CA6B&} {\1c&HE2BB6F&}y{\1c&HC9A47A&}a{\1c&HB69283&} {\1c&HA07F8C&}k{\1c&H896997&}n{\1c&H7053A2&}o{\1c&H4D34B0&}w{\1c&H3019BE&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:09.98,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}O{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H709A4A&}r{\1c&H6AA457&} {\1c&H64AF63&}w{\1c&H5ABF77&}i{\1c&H56C680&}s{\1c&H4FD38E&}h{\1c&H48E09E&} {\1c&H43E8A8&}i{\1c&H4EE2AC&}s{\1c&H5FD9B2&} {\1c&H6ED1B7&}t{\1c&H7FC7BD&}o{\1c&H92BDC3&} {\1c&HA3B4C8&}b{\1c&HB8A8CF&}e{\1c&HCA9ED5&} {\1c&HDC95DB&}h{\1c&HED8DDD&}a{\1c&HEE95CE&}p{\1c&HEF9DBF&}p{\1c&HF0A5B1&}y{\1c&HF0AAA6&},{\1c&HF1AF9D&} {\1c&HF2B68F&}h{\1c&HF3BE80&}a{\1c&HF4C672&}p{\1c&HEDC46B&}p{\1c&HD5AF75&}y{\1c&HC6A27C&},{\1c&HB69383&} {\1c&H9F7E8D&}h{\1c&H866798&}a{\1c&H6E51A2&}p{\1c&H563BAD&}p{\1c&H3E26B7&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:13.78,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}A{\1c&H778D3A&}n{\1c&H6F9B4B&}d{\1c&H66AA5D&} {\1c&H60B56A&}t{\1c&H59C179&}h{\1c&H50D18C&}o{\1c&H48E09E&}s{\1c&H4BE4AB&}e{\1c&H61D8B2&} {\1c&H73CEB9&}d{\1c&H8BC1C0&}a{\1c&HA3B4C8&}y{\1c&HB9A8D0&}s{\1c&HCC9DD6&} {\1c&HE490DE&}w{\1c&HED91D7&}i{\1c&HEE95CF&}l{\1c&HEE98C8&}l{\1c&HEF9EBE&} {\1c&HF0A6AF&}b{\1c&HF1AF9E&}e{\1c&HF2B690&} {\1c&HF3BE80&}h{\1c&HF4C76F&}a{\1c&HE5BE6E&}p{\1c&HCAA57A&}p{\1c&HAF8C86&}y{\1c&H9E7D8D&},{\1c&H8C6C95&} {\1c&H77599E&}t{\1c&H5C41AA&}o{\1c&H4128B6&}o{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:21.37,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.17,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:38.01,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:48.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. I've never been here, but this place feels just like Grandpa's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:50.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She has her schoolbag on a Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:54.07,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:57.21,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.36,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,we ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You wh-wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your in-laws will worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:02.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:07.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it... uh... you know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.41,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is it what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:12.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You know. Your husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:13.18,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.04,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Part of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:15.88,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Part of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:18.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And his parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:19.76,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's a part of it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:26.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I guess it's difficult to live with your in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:31.56,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's even possible for a wife to live with in-laws in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:37.40,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I have no brothers or sisters and there's nowhere else for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}That's the math book we use, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Can we stay here, Dai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:39.69,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Let me see your other textbooks, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:44.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's talk things through first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.20,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Sure. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now, what about your in-laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Your Japanese book is different from mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.28,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:48.38,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I left a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.45,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I wanna see yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.16,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't say where we were going though...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Sure, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:52.58,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Only that I'd take Reina to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:54.17,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Other than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.96,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't really think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't even told my parents yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Didn't think"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:03:59.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You have your daughter to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.01,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like I had a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:06.60,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I had to get out of that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:07.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't stand it another second!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go grocery shopping for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.19,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have much, but you can take the right room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.32,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It really is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.32,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. It's a little heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:29.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you cram in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:33.12,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's slippers and textbooks are in there, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised you made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:42.30,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai, you don't usually put much thought into meals, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.38,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight, I'll cook you a real dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I {\i1}do{\i0} think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:48.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we look at sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:50.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can each choose one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.18,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.73,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of meat should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's all the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:04:59.02,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Not that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:04:59.32,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.28,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, this one's a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.95,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:12.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai, this ground beef and pork combo is really cheap...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:18.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... This isn't what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is Haruko, my cousin from my mother's side!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:24.01,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares what side I'm from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:25.30,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:26.80,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:33.35,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}My son is a classmate of Rin's. Daikichi is always helping me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:32.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell am I saying?! She even didn't ask who it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:35.68,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I feel the need to explain it to her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:35.68,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Oh? Then my daughter is the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.14,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"This isn't what it looks like"?! What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:39.52,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:40.31,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's a first-grader this year, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:40.98,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:40.98,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of sweets did you pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.40,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:46.95,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.53,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Deluxe Big Nyan Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:52.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting vegetable sponge cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.41,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting Meow Meow Kitty candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:00.04,Default,Moms,0000,0000,0000,,Are those really sweets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.38,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}She's pretty, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:14.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Y-Yeah, I suppose she's one of the more attractive moms...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:18.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}But I don't think you should have an affair with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}A-Are you out of your mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:22.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It's not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:25.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}In the first place, she has enough trouble taking care of Kouki on her own!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:26.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}She doesn't have the time to—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:27.49,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,"On her own"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:29.24,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}So during lunch at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:28.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:30.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You watch too many weird dramas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:30.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.49,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}A bug got out of its cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:33.41,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm guessing she's two or three years older than us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why should I care how old she is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:38.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So, is she divorced?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.22,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't had this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:51.18,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I experimented a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Usually, everything is made to my mother-in-law's tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:57.81,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, I wanna have this at home, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:02.90,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.57,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:08.15,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.40,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Reina. Hold your chopsticks properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.53,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.20,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,The floor creaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:16.20,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Here, Reina, use this towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.37,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:18.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:19.90,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,A bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.12,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.00,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't pull on it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.26,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are they asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.39,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,They were both pretty excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I moved Rin to your futon, Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:42.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:42.90,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.19,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That hit the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:48.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's been so long since I've had alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:52.75,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I gain weight easily these days, so no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:54.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:56.13,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you calling me fat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:57.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.59,0:07:59.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that we're in our thirties now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.29,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine with being thirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:05.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You can't act the same as when you were younger, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:07.34,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:10.84,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,On the other hand, my husband doesn't even look at me anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:12.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know why I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:19.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:24.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,While you were all taking a bath, I called your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:25.65,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.98,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do anything weird, Dai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You want everyone there to worry about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:36.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All I said was that you two were fine and are going to stay here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even give my address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.62,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I left a note so it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.16,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Leave me be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:45.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can do what you want, but what about Reina?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:49.75,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's with me and she's fine too, so there's no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:56.84,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That may be, but if you don't tell them where you are and that Reina's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:09:00.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,how the hell are the people who are waiting gonna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:02.27,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't care less about them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You need to be a little more level-headed about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you just wanna make trouble for your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:05.48,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:11.94,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:12.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:18.82,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:24.62,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa and Mama are always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:26.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:30.75,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Even though they're married. But I always pretend I'm sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.26,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:35.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.01,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's my cheek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:45.35,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Every day, I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:50.56,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since I got married, I've had to hide how I felt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:53.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I deserve this much, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.82,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.59,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have said those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:03.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.62,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:14.88,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:33.36,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:35.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.33,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:51.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:52.88,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.00,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, are you making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:56.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:00.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.43,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Dai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:04.30,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You have Rin make breakfast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What do you think I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We always cook together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And when we use the stove, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:17.90,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you've got rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.57,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't take too long to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:24.24,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to school by train today...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:24.24,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:27.33,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:27.33,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on? It's so early...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:29.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:32.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're disturbing the neighbors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:34.79,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is your school far, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:35.71,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You already have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:41.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's mom is busy, so he always comes over early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:46.01,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.06,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you get married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:50.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not! She's my cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.10,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. I knew it was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean "I knew"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:57.40,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, do you wanna get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:11:59.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:02.49,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, you like being single, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.57,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's "single"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:07.41,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.48,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know that one! "Divorce", right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.41,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know "divorce"!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:16.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, your mom is married but single is better...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:19.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're single, but is married better for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:21.84,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Adults really are weird, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They are, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:27.93,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You had breakfast before coming, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.22,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:34.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was mine though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.85,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Didn't you already eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Why are you still hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.49,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're too nice for your own good, Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:41.49,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:42.94,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I ate it because I wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What, 'cause I gave him a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:43.99,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:45.11,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:45.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:48.95,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're just as busy as she is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.95,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You really do have a thing for that beautiful mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:55.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,St-Stu... Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:01.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I just thought I'd help her out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}And Rin gets along with them too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I don't know the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:11.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm pretty sure Kouki and his mother have been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:14.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It would be rude of me to be too forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:20.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It must be hard, being a woman on her own...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:26.86,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! I told you, hurry or you'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.20,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Mama always has just one piece of toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:25.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.86,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}She says she's on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.95,Default,Kid A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:30.37,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.74,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell anyone we're staying with Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.54,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.62,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Because I said so! Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:37.54,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:38.79,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:39.98,Default,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:42.21,Default,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, did you come with your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:43.76,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:47.34,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,We secretly ran away from home, so I came by train today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:49.68,Default,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:14.79,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.20,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:19.12,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you to hold on tight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.75,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna get another one for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:26.80,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe it'll get home before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.34,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! Maybe it will!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:37.85,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Have a nice evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:39.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You're working late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:41.98,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my husband's watching him at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. How's Yuu doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:44.98,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.24,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's so rambunctious these days. I can barely handle him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:52.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But it's nice that your husband helps out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:53.78,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:56.16,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,His business trip was suddenly rescheduled, so he had the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:15:00.71,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can rely on my husband to raise our kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:04.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:06.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:07.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:26.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're home! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.41,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,They fell asleep right away tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not going to turn this into a big deal, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:46.21,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean divorce or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.05,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No worries. That won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What the hell? I wasted time worrying about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:59.56,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have thought about it a number of times...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.81,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I think about it almost every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:08.73,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I think of my husband as the enemy while living in his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:12.70,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Other than Reina, I feel like the whole house is against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:15.24,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like the two of us make up the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:19.54,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But that isn't being very realistic, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:23.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's Reina... and whether I can support us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:27.21,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And all the problems I'd have to face before I'd even reach that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:33.18,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,At the end of the day, it looks like I'm better off where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:36.64,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I got engaged soon after I joined the company...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:42.43,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When I was young, all I thought about was becoming a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.79,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I have no choice... do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:48.27,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And that's the only way I can protect Reina...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:54.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've never been married, but it sounds hard, even for a normal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai, you're doing it all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:58.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:01.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I haven't been able to do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.71,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true. Rin looks really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.58,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Like when she's cooking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:12.42,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And Kouki and his mom are doing their best alone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:15.09,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina and I will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:16.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's always just you and Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:19.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you talk to your husband about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:23.73,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He works overtime every night. We've never have a decent conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.45,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Reina and I will try our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:31.15,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I've been putting up with it for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.94,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:37.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I ignore it, I should be able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:40.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds really unhealthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:41.99,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's just the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd be dead if I {\i1}didn't{\i0} do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:48.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten stronger, Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.42,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:52.21,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After you give birth and raise a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:55.34,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,there are times when you need to be strong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.26,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Especially when they're still babies...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what it's like with a baby, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:05.98,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And while you're keeping that up, for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:07.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,you naturally become like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.06,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't wanna be an old woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:14.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't try to get stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:21.03,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,If I could, I'd be young forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:30.00,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We'll go home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:32.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is "marriage"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What does it mean to be a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's your turn, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.06,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.48,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.40,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.36,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.95,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's coming after he finishes his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:00.82,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He's never this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.78,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm positive it's Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.66,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:07.00,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not him! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:10.70,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.50,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about you, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.46,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:16.42,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:21.06,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? So if he wants to get off work early, he {\i1}can{\i0}, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:23.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't put it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:24.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough working for a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.39,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hideyuki, you ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.31,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:30.10,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko caused you so much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:33.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, no... I didn't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:36.07,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I really don't know what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:36.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm wearing the wrong clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.74,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot, Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:44.87,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Papa should've at least gotten our bags, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.37,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He's so inconsiderate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.45,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I know! He's {\i1}inconsirit{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:54.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you ever feel like it, you can come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:58.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no... I've bothered you enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No... That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:04.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is always saying that she wants to see Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:11.02,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you... Dai...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:11.85,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:14.61,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Then can we come again on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.31,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,L-Listen, Reina...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:20.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When she was young, Haruko was such a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:25.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Last night, she muttered that she wanted to stay young forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:28.08,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:31.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you come, pack a little lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:32.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I hate even looking at that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.08,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:38.21,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Girls always have a heavy load to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.05,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:40.92,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:42.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:57.98,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:21:01.03,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:07.90,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:12.41,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:17.92,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:22.63,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:27.46,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:32.84,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:37.69,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:43.17,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:48.11,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:53.56,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:58.63,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:03.84,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:17.85,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.85,0:22:18.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.91,0:22:22.19,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe this one suits you more, Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:22.90,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Here, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:24.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I try this one on too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:26.15,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:27.78,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:30.20,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She just has to try this one on...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:32.83,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, this one's cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:36.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki and I are gonna go wander around...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:37.75,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:40.12,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,See, this one is really you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:39.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:42.04,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You look so cute, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:48.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That{\i0} good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:50.05,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It tastes like summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:53.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I hear ya!
